  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Optimized four-color poison proliferate combo deck that leverages Atraxa's proliferate trigger alongside dedicated combo lines for inevitability. Deploys fast mana through Chrome Mox, Mana Vault, and Glistening Sphere to accelerate into threats. Primary win condition: Tekuthal + Contagion Engine + Magistrate's Scepter for infinite turns, proliferating poison counters each turn. Secondary line: Shrieking Drake + Crystalline Crawler + Inexorable Tide for infinite proliferate. Backup plan: Blightsteel Colossus for one-shot infect kills. Tutors (Demonic, Vampiric, Enlightened) find combo pieces reliably, while free counterspells (Force of Will, Fierce Guardianship) protect the combo turn."
  },
